{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cactus Simulator Remake is a game in which you can become a cactus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will give you a meditative gameplay. You can stand and contemplate the beauty of the desert around you living your life as a cactus. You can also perform actions that cactus usually perform (stand in the same place).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New game engine</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved optimization</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved settings menu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful stylized graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 game mods: arcade and realistic </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic change of day and night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 localizations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Canonical Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a cactus </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're in the desert </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are other cacti around you </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And not only cacti</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner Cactus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498560/76d6951abe84b234cf5b30964118f6d8810daf84.jpg"},{"name":"Noob Cactus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498560/f9712cd5d33d4ec6dd0b80ff020bb64fd80ddcf2.jpg"},{"name":"Ordinary Cactus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3498560/e92d7ba154f5808a0159b849051db37da93f7220.jpg"},{"name":"Unusual Cactus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3